Third-party material committed to this repository
==================================================

Each entry names the files, their author, where they came from and the licence they are under. A
file listed here is NOT covered by the licence this repository states for its own work; its own
licence governs it. Which licence covers which file is REUSE.toml's to say; this list is the
credits for what was copied in.

